  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <header>
    <div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px">
      <div class="logo">WC</div>
      <div>
        <div style="font-weight:800">{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</div>
        <div style="font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)">{{TAGLINE}}</div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <nav>
      <a href="index.html">Studio</a>
      <a href="about.html">Meet</a>
      <a href="services.html">Offerings</a>
      <a href="programs.html">Programs</a>
      <a href="pricing.html">Rates</a>
      <a href="testimonials.html">Praise</a>
      <a href="book.html">Reserve</a>
    </nav>
  </header>

  <main class="container">
    <h1 style="margin:8px 0 4px">Praise from recent cohorts</h1>
    <p style="margin:0 0 18px;color:var(--muted)">Snapshot notes from people who built small, steady practices with cohort support.</p>

    <section class="cards">
      <article class="card">
        <blockquote>"I finally have a weekly shape that fits: short, doable activities that stack into reliable mornings. The group nudges kept me honest in the best way."</blockquote>
        <div class="meta">— S., product designer</div>
      </article>

      <article class="card">
        <blockquote>"Three months later, I can see what I tweak weekly to feel less scattered. The prompts and templates were surprisingly human — not overwhelming."</blockquote>
        <div class="meta">— A., teacher</div>
      </article>

      <article class="card">
        <blockquote>"I brought one tiny habit into the course and it kept multiplying. I appreciate the clarity and the check-ins — gentle, structured, kind."</blockquote>
        <div class="meta">— R., engineer</div>
      </article>

      <article class="card">
        <blockquote>"Regular, small goals made my week feel deliberate. I now use the simple templates the coach shared whenever I need to reset."</blockquote>
        <div class="meta">— M., entrepreneur</div>
      </article>
    </section>

    <section style="margin-top:20px">
      <div class="card">
        <h3 style="margin-top:0">Try a 7-day taster — make a checklist</h3>
        <p class="small">Build a tiny challenge to test a new routine for a week. Print and tape it somewhere visible.</p>

        <div class="builder">
          <label for="tName">Challenge title</label>
          <input id="tName" type="text" placeholder="e.g., Evening unwind" />
          <label for="tAction">What you'll do</label>
          <input id="tAction" type="text" placeholder="e.g., 10 minute calm practice: stretch + breath" />
          <div style="display:flex;gap:8px;margin-top:10px">
            <button id="tBuild" class="btn">Create checklist</button>
            <button id="tPrint" style="padding:10px;border-radius:8px;border:1px solid #e6e6e6;background:#fff">Print</button>
          </div>
          <ol id="tChecklist" class="checklist"></ol>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section style="margin-top:18px">
      <div class="card">
        <h3 style="margin:0 0 8px">Share a quick note</h3>
        <p class="small">If a cohort or session helped, it means a lot. Share short feedback or an experience for others to see.</p>
        <div style="margin-top:12px">
          <a class="btn" href="mailto:{{EMAIL}}?subject=Feedback">Send a note</a>
          <a style="margin-left:10px" class="btn" href="book.html">Book a 1:1 follow-up</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

  </main>

  <footer>
    <div style="max-width:1000px;margin:18px auto;padding:0 20px;color:var(--muted)">
      <div style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;flex-wrap:wrap">
        <div>{{BUSINESS_NAME}} — serving {{CITY}}, {{STATE}}</div>
        <div><a href="tel:{{PHONE}}">{{PHONE}}</a> • <a href="mailto:{{EMAIL}}">{{EMAIL}}</a></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </footer>

  <script>
    // Small habit builder used on this page too
    (function(){
      const buildBtn = document.getElementById('tBuild');
      const printBtn = document.getElementById('tPrint');
      const nameIn = document.getElementById('tName');
      const actionIn = document.getElementById('tAction');
      const list = document.getElementById('tChecklist');

      buildBtn.addEventListener('click', function(){
        list.innerHTML = '';
        const name = nameIn.value || '7-day challenge';
        const action = actionIn.value || 'Do the practice';
        for(let d=1; d<=7; d++){
          const li = document.createElement('li');
          li.textContent = 'Day ' + d + ': ' + action;
          list.appendChild(li);
        }
      });

      printBtn.addEventListener('click', function(){
        const name = nameIn.value || '7-day challenge';
        const action = actionIn.value || 'Do the practice';
        let w = window.open('','_blank');
        w.document.write('<html><head><title>' + name + '</title></head><body>');
        w.document.write('<h2>' + name + '</h2>');
        w.document.write('<ol>');
        for(let i=1;i<=7;i++) w.document.write('<li>Day ' + i + ': ' + action + '</li>');
        w.document.write('</ol>');
        w.document.write('<script>setTimeout(function(){window.print();},200);</script>');
        w.document.write('</body></html>');
        w.document.close();
      });
    })();
  </script>
</body>
</html>"} 
{"path":"book.html","content":"<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1" />
  <title>Reserve — {{BUSINESS_NAME}}</title>
  <style>
    :root{--bg:#f7fbf6;--accent:#6a8a6a;--muted:#6b6b6b}
    body{font-family:Inter,system-ui,Arial;color:#142;line-height:1.45;margin:0;background:var(--bg)}
    header{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;padding:16px 22px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(150,180,160,0.06),transparent)}
    .logo{width:48px;height:48px;border-radius:10px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--accent),#7fb79f);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;color:white;font-weight:800}
    nav a{margin:0 10px;text-decoration:none;color:#2a4;font-weight:700}
    .container{max-width:1000px;margin:22px auto;padding:0 20px}
    .panel{background:#fff;border-radius:12px;padding:18px;border:1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.04);box-shadow:0 8px 24px rgba(21,34,21,0.03)}
    h1{margin:0 0 8px}
    .muted{color:var(--muted)}
    .grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 360px;gap:18px}
    label{display:block;margin:8px 0 6px;font-weight:700}
    input[type="text"],input[type="date"],select,textarea{width:100%;padding:10px;border-radius:8px;border:1px solid #e6e6e6}
    .btn{background:var(--accent);color:white;padding:10px 14px;border-radius:10px;text-decoration:none;font-weight:700;border:none}
    .secondary{background:#fff;border:1px solid #e6e6e6;color:#333}
    .session-summary{white-space:pre-wrap;background:#f7fff7;padding:12px;border-radius:8px;border:1px dashed rgba(106,138,106,0.15);margin-top:10px}
    .habit-block{margin-top:18px;padding:12px;border-radius:10px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,#fff,#fcfdfb)}
    @media(max-width:900px){.grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}}
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <header>
    <div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px">
      <div class="logo">WC</div>
      <div>
        <div style="font-weight:800">{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</div>
        <div style="font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)">{{TAGLINE}}</div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <nav>
      <a href="index.html">Studio</a>
      <a href="about.html">Meet</a>
      <a href="services.html">Offerings</a>
      <a href="programs.html">Programs</a>
      <a href="pricing.html">Rates</a>
      <a href="testimonials.html">Praise</a>
      <a href="book.html">Reserve</a>
    </nav>
  </header>

  <main class="container">
    <div class="grid">
      <section>
        <div class="panel">
          <h1>Reserve a session or cohort seat</h1>
          <p class="muted">Choose a format, sketch the focus, and build a personalized session plan below. When you're ready, you'll be able to copy a plain-text summary to paste into email or your calendar.</p>

          <form id="bookingForm" onsubmit="return false;" style="margin-top:14px">
            <label for="format">Format</label>
            <select id="format">
              <option>Clarity session — 60 min</option>
              <option>Check-in — 30 min</option>
              <option>Seasonal cohort seat</option>
              <option>Spark cohort seat</option>
            </select>

            <label for="date">Prefered date</label>
            <input id="date" type="date" />

            <label for="focus">Primary focus for this session</label>
            <input id="focus" type="text" placeholder="e.g., morning routine; energy management; habit stacking" />

            <label for="notes">Key context (what matters now)</label>
            <textarea id="notes" rows="4" placeholder="Short context: routines, constraints, things that help/derail you"></textarea>

            <div style="display:flex;gap:8px;margin-top:12px">
              <button id="buildPlan" class="btn">Build my session plan</button>
              <button id="bookNow" class="secondary">Proceed to booking link</button>
            </div>

            <div id="plannerArea" style="margin-top:12px"></div>
          </form>

          <div style="margin-top:16px">
            <h3 style="margin:0 0 8px">Quick habit tester</h3>
            <div class="habit-block">
              <label for="hbName">Tiny habit label</label>
              <input id="hbName" type="text" placeholder="e.g., After coffee: 2 stretches" />
              <label for="hbTrigger">When it happens (trigger)</label>
              <input id="hbTrigger" type="text" placeholder="e.g., after my morning coffee" />
              <div style="display:flex;gap:8px;margin-top:10px">
                <button id="hbBuild" class="btn">Make 7-day checklist</button>
                <button id="hbPrint" class="secondary">Print checklist</button>
              </div>
              <ol id="hbList" style="margin-top:10px"></ol>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <aside>
        <div class="panel">
          <h3 style="margin-top:0">Session Planner</h3>
          <p class="muted">A quick structure we'll follow in a session — objectives, micro-practices, and next steps.</p>

          <div style="margin-top:12px">
            <label for="goal">Top goals (comma separated)</label>
            <input id="goal" type="text" placeholder="Focus, restore energy, simplify" />
            <label for="duration">Desired session length (minutes)</label>
            <input id="duration" type="number" value="60" />
            <label>Preferred format</label>
            <select id="prefFormat"><option>Conversation + action plan</option><option>Guided practice + reflection</option><option>Workshop-style</option></select>
            <label for="prep">Anything to prepare?</label>
            <input id="prep" type="text" placeholder="e.g., bring a notebook, a quiet chair" />

            <div style="display:flex;gap:8px;margin-top:12px">
              <button id="planBtn" class="btn">Compose plan</button>
              <button id="copyPlan" class="secondary">Copy summary</button>
            </div>

            <div id="planOutput" class="session-summary" style="margin-top:10px;display:none"></div>
          </div>

          <div style="margin-top:12px;color:var(--muted);font-size:13px">Prefer to reserve by phone? <a href="tel:{{PHONE}}">Call {{PHONE}}</a></div>
        </div>

        <div style="margin-top:12px" class="panel">
          <h4 style="margin:0">Need a different time?</h4>
          <p class="muted">If scheduling here is tight, send a quick note and we'll offer alternatives.</p>
          <div style="margin-top:10px"><a class="btn" href="mailto:{{EMAIL}}?subject=Scheduling%20request">Email a request</a></div>
        </div>
      </aside>
    </div>
  </main>

  <footer style="padding:18px 20px;margin-top:18px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,#fff,#f5f9f3)">
    <div style="max-width:1000px;margin:0 auto;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center">
      <div>{{BUSINESS_NAME}} • {{CITY}}, {{STATE}}</div>
      <div><a href="mailto:{{EMAIL}}">{{EMAIL}}</a> • <a href="tel:{{PHONE}}">{{PHONE}}</a></div>
    </div>
  </footer>

  <script>
    // Session Planner: builds a plain-text summary and allows copy/export
    (function(){
      const planBtn = document.getElementById('planBtn');
      const copyPlan = document.getElementById('copyPlan');
      const planOutput = document.getElementById('planOutput');
      const goal = document.getElementById('goal');
      const duration = document.getElementById('duration');
      const prefFormat = document.getElementById('prefFormat');
      const prep = document.getElementById('prep');

      function compose(){
        const goals = (goal.value||'').split(',').map(s=>s.trim()).filter(Boolean);
        const dur = duration.value || '60';
        const format = prefFormat.value;
        const prepText = prep.value || 'No special prep.';

        // Create a friendly summary
        let lines = [];
        lines.push('Session plan — ' + new Date().toLocaleDateString());
        if(goals.length) lines.push('Top focus: ' + goals.join(' • '));
        lines.push('Length: ' + dur + ' minutes');
        lines.push('Format: ' + format);
        lines.push('Prep: ' + prepText);

        // Add structured flow
        lines.push('');
        lines.push('Suggested flow:');
        lines.push('- Welcome & quick check-in (5-10 min)');
        lines.push('- Clarify one main goal and the barrier to it (10-15 min)');
        lines.push('- Practice or mapping: 15-25 min (small, repeatable activities + why they matter)');
        lines.push('- Concrete next steps & accountability (5-10 min)');

        lines.push('');
        lines.push('Micro-practices you might try:');
        lines.push('- Short anchor practice (1–3 min) to reset energy');
        lines.push('- A brief planning prompt to shape the week');

        lines.push('');
        lines.push('Outcomes we’ll aim for:');
        lines.push('- One simple habit you can repeat this week');
        lines.push('- A 3-step plan to support it');

        return lines.join('\n');
      }

      planBtn.addEventListener('click', function(e){
        e.preventDefault();
        const text = compose();
        planOutput.style.display = 'block';
        planOutput.textContent = text;
      });

      copyPlan.addEventListener('click', function(){
        if(planOutput.style.display === 'none'){ alert('Build the plan first.'); return; }
        navigator.clipboard.writeText(planOutput.textContent).then(function(){
          copyPlan.textContent = 'Copied!';
          setTimeout(()=>copyPlan.textContent = 'Copy summary',1200);
        }, function(){ alert('Copy failed — select and copy manually.'); });
      });

      // Booking button goes to primary CTA URL but includes a summary in a mailto as fallback
      document.getElementById('bookNow').addEventListener('click', function(){
        const p = compose();
        // try to open the booking link in a new tab
        const url = '{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}' || 'mailto:{{EMAIL}}?subject=Booking%20request';
        // if booking URL is mailto, include body
        if(url.startsWith('mailto:')){
          const mail = url + '&body=' + encodeURIComponent(p);
          window.location.href = mail;
        } else {
          // attempt to open with details in query (best-effort)
          const qurl = url + (url.includes('?')? '&' : '?') + 'notes=' + encodeURIComponent(p);
          window.open(qurl,'_blank');
        }
      });
    })();

    // Habit builder here as well (printable checklist)
    (function(){
      const hbBuild = document.getElementById('hbBuild');
      const hbPrint = document.getElementById('hbPrint');
      const hbName = document.getElementById('hbName');
      const hbTrigger = document.getElementById('hbTrigger');
      const hbList = document.getElementById('hbList');

      hbBuild.addEventListener('click', function(){
        hbList.innerHTML = '';
        const title = hbName.value || '7-day habit';
        const trigger = hbTrigger.value || '';
        for(let i=1;i<=7;i++){
          const li = document.createElement('li');
          li.textContent = 'Day ' + i + ': ' + title + (trigger ? (' — when ' + trigger) : '');
          hbList.appendChild(li);
        }
      });

      hbPrint.addEventListener('click', function(){
        const title = hbName.value || '7-day habit';
        const trigger = hbTrigger.value || '';
        const w = window.open('','_blank');
        w.document.write('<html><head><title>' + title + '</title></head><body>');
        w.document.write('<h2>' + title + '</h2>');
        if(trigger) w.document.write('<p>Trigger: ' + trigger + '</p>');
        w.document.write('<ol>');
        for(let i=1;i<=7;i++) w.document.write('<li>Day ' + i + (trigger ? (': do it when ' + trigger) : '') + '</li>');
        w.document.write('</ol>');
        w.document.write('<script>setTimeout(function(){window.print();},200);</script>');
        w.document.write('</body></html>');
        w.document.close();
      });
    })();
  </script>
</body>
</html>"} 
